message: "If you use Extra in your research, benchmarks, or software implementations, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "EXTRA: Open-Source Computer Use Protocol & High-Speed Desktop Automation Engine"
authors:
  - name: "AIYantra Engineering Team"
    email: "engineering@yantraos.com"
    affiliation: "yantraOS / Euryale Ferox Private Limited"
