  - "accessibility-tree"
  - "sovereign-ai"
abstract: >-
  Extra is a flashless, token-efficient, open-source Computer Use AI protocol
  and Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that connects large language models
  (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Cursor) to physical desktop operating systems
  across Linux (Wayland/X11), macOS, and Windows. It replaces screenshot polling
  with native accessibility trees (AT-SPI2, UIA, AXUIElement) and direct GPU
  frame capture, achieving sub-3ms action dispatch and up to 225x lower token costs.
